Introduction of Cypress.
1. Front End web based automation tool.
2. Its tool to test modern web based application (websites uses angularJS and reactJS frameworks)
3. Cypress capable to automate any applciation which runs over browser.
4. Cypress support only 2 langugage binding - Javascript and TypeScript
5. Cypress doesnt; hold selenium library its completely different from selenium.
6. Cypress is an opensource - tool
		1. Cypress Runner - Open Sources (80% of automation tasks, writing , reading, executing, creating custom function etc.)
		2. Cypress dashboard - testcases maintence , parallel execution come with paid version of cypress.
7. Cypress run on node.js environment (similar like selenium runs on jDK/JRE).

Who, can use cypress ? 
1. Initially dev team uses cypress - unit, integration
2. QA has strted using cypress
		1. E2E
		2. API testing 
		3. Accessibility testing (paid).

